// mass_battle_100v100's MassHeal — single-target ally Heal(18.0). The
// first friendly-targeted EffectOp in this fixture; proves the
// apply_ability dispatcher emits kind=27 EffectHealApplied chronicle
// records at production scale.
//
// Lowers to AbilityProgram { gate: { cooldown_ticks: 0, hostile_only: false },
//                            area: SingleTarget { range: 999.0 },
//                            effects: [EffectOp::Heal { amount: 18.0 }] }.
//
// `target: ally` flips `hostile_only` to `false`; the .sim's body-side
// level-pair check inverts to the ally predicate (same-team levels) so
// dispatch lands on a SAME-TEAM ally.

ability MassHeal {
    target: ally
    range: 999
    cooldown: 0

    heal 18
}
